Kitten4(.bcm4) -> Godot 4 converter.
IMPORTANT: read AGENTS.md first. The repo layout is messy; the only live
implementation lives in 新版本/. Skip _backup/_out/_cache/_shots (gitignored).
Read 技术路线汇报.md then 新版本/README.md before touching code.
core.js (163KB) and emit.js (143KB) are huge - locate first, never read whole.
Verify with: cd 新版本; pwsh -File _dev\regress.ps1
New .ps1 files MUST be saved as UTF-8 with BOM.

WORKS: simple projects convert well; multi-screen/screen-switching is supported.

STATUS (check before assuming something is broken):
  1. broadcast/广播 triggering - FIXED (round 21, custom signal system)
  2. pen layer vs sprite layer ordering - FIXED (round 22; the real order is in
     scene.group_order, NOT scene.actors which is usually an empty array)
  3. sprite collision - NOT implemented (mask baking not started)
  4. physics - NOT implemented
  5. large-game performance - greatly improved (round 23: 223.6ms -> 6.2ms per
     frame on PICKCAT斗地主) but still being optimized
  6. sprite facing may be 180 degrees off - NEEDS VERIFICATION (likely a real bug)

Items 3-4 mean implementing NEW capability - confirm design intent before
guessing semantics. Items 5-6 need actual measurement/profiling, not guesswork.
Use the 16 .bcm4 files in 测试用例/ to reproduce
(广播测试, 画笔图层与印章测试, 精灵战争...).

ARCHITECTURE CHANGED (round 24): the 全局/角色类.gd layer was REMOVED. Block
implementations now live in the global singleton K4Func (全局/函数单例.gd) with
`角色: 角色变量` as the first parameter; role scripts now `extends 角色变量`.

Framework by Gwier, implemented with DeepSeek Harness.
